<title>USA: Austin's Edwin Freakley resigns as CEO.</title>
<headline>Austin's Edwin Freakley resigns as CEO.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austin's International Inc said on Monday Edwin Freakley resigned as director, chairman of the board and chief executive effective September 26.</p>
<p>The restaurant owner and operator said Freakley resigned as a result of the termination of a management agreement between the company and Worrell Enterprises Inc.</p>
<p>Freakley had held these positions under the terms of that agreement, it said.</p>
<p>The company said it had not yet named a successor.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
